    "title": "Police searching for missing woman last seen in Parkville area - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Chris Montcalmo ,\n13 hours ago PARKVILLE, MD—Police in Baltimore County are searching for a missing woman.\nMelissa Moore, 49, is 5’05” tall and weighs 145 pounds.\nShe was last seen on Monday, November 17 in the Parkville area wearing a red jacket, blue/black sweatpants, and black tennis shoes.\nAnyone with information on Melissa Moore’s whereabouts is asked to dial 9-1-1 or call police at 410-887-5310.\n2",
